<h1>CanStage</h1>
<p class="by">By Morten Ervik (IARC/CIN), Giulio Napolitano (NICR), and Lisa Ranaghan (NICR)</p>
<hr width="75%" />
<p class="welcome">Welcome to CanStage, a Cancer Staging Tool, provided to you thanks to a NICR, IARC, and UICC collaboration. The tool will help maximise the availability, standardisation and comparability of cancer staging internationally.</p>
